y'll  find from all over the world every year  we take on few big cases and we donate  those treatments Adela has a point stain  on her face and she's had so many  different types of treatments and  nothing really has worked for her  very thankful for her because she's  making my dream come true you know I  used to use the heavy makeup to cover  inner layer layer it's a big difference  it used to be four times more great the  best part about this it's seeing people  transform and that's why I'm so grateful  that I never gave up on my journey I was  able to help thousands of people  [Music]
 

